    <article class="doc">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/docs">Docs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/docs/closing">Closing</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">Multi-entity close</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <header class="doc-head">
        <h1>Close several entities at once</h1>
        <p class="lead">Group subsidiaries under a parent, run one checklist, and let Ledgerline post intercompany eliminations for you.</p>
        <p class="meta">
          <span class="badge">Beta</span>
          <span>API version <code>2026-09-01</code></span>
          <span>Last reviewed <time datetime="2026-09-29">29 September 2026</time></span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="status-note" role="note">
        <strong>Beta</strong>
        <p>Multi-entity close is in beta. The API shape is stable; the dashboard checklist may change before general availability in Q1 2027.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>Multi-entity close lets a parent company close every subsidiary from one checklist. Each entity keeps its own ledger; the checklist and eliminations are shared.</p>

        <div class="callout callout--info">
          <p class="callout-title">Available on Scale and Enterprise</p>
          <p>Multi-entity close needs at least two entities with the same fiscal calendar.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="before-you-start">Before you start</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Every entity has a functional currency set.</li>
          <li>Intercompany accounts are mapped in <a href="/guides/intercompany-mapping">Intercompany mapping</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="create-a-close-group">Create a close group</h2>
        <p>A close group is the parent and the entities it closes. Create one from the dashboard or the API.</p>

        <div class="code-tabs" id="ci-doc-close-group" data-sync-key="sdk">
          <div class="bar">
            <p class="ct-title">Create a close group</p>
            <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Language">
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="ci-doc-close-group-tab-curl" aria-controls="ci-doc-close-group-panel-curl" aria-selected="true" data-lang="curl">cURL</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="ci-doc-close-group-tab-typescript" aria-controls="ci-doc-close-group-panel-typescript" aria-selected="false" data-lang="typescript" tabindex="-1">Node.js</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" id="ci-doc-close-group-tab-python" aria-controls="ci-doc-close-group-panel-python" aria-selected="false" data-lang="python" tabindex="-1">Python</button>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="copy" aria-label="Copy code">Copy</button>
          </div>
    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="ci-doc-close-group-panel-curl" aria-labelledby="ci-doc-close-group-tab-curl" data-lang="curl">
        <pre class="code"><code class="language-curl"><span class="line">curl https://api.ledgerline.com/v2/close-groups \</span><span class="line">  -H "Authorization: Bearer $LEDGERLINE_KEY" \</span><span class="line">  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \</span><span class="line">  -d '&#123;</span><span class="line">    "name": "Northbeam group",</span><span class="line">    "parent": "ent_northbeam_inc",</span><span class="line">    "entities": ["ent_northbeam_uk", "ent_northbeam_ca"]</span><span class="line">  &#125;'</span></code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="ci-doc-close-group-panel-typescript" aria-labelledby="ci-doc-close-group-tab-typescript" data-lang="typescript" hidden>
        <p class="filename">create-close-group.ts</p>
        <pre class="code"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="line">import &#123; Ledgerline &#125; from "@ledgerline/node";</span><span class="line"></span><span class="line">const ll = new Ledgerline(process.env.LEDGERLINE_KEY!);</span><span class="line"></span><span class="line">await ll.closeGroups.create(&#123;</span><span class="line">  name: "Northbeam group",</span><span class="line">  parent: "ent_northbeam_inc",</span><span class="line">  entities: ["ent_northbeam_uk", "ent_northbeam_ca"],</span><span class="line">&#125;);</span></code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="ci-doc-close-group-panel-python" aria-labelledby="ci-doc-close-group-tab-python" data-lang="python" hidden>
        <p class="filename">create_close_group.py</p>
        <pre class="code"><code class="language-python"><span class="line">from ledgerline import Ledgerline</span><span class="line"></span><span class="line">ll = Ledgerline(os.environ["LEDGERLINE_KEY"])</span><span class="line"></span><span class="line">ll.close_groups.create(</span><span class="line">    name="Northbeam group",</span><span class="line">    parent="ent_northbeam_inc",</span><span class="line">    entities=["ent_northbeam_uk", "ent_northbeam_ca"],</span><span class="line">)</span></code></pre>
    </div>
        </div>

        <h3 id="order-of-operations">Order of operations</h3>
        <div class="table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">Runs on</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>Bank reconciliation</td><td>Each entity</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Intercompany eliminations</td><td>The parent</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Consolidated reports</td><td>The parent</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="callout callout--warning">
          <p class="callout-title">Lock periods last</p>
          <p>Locking an entity before eliminations post blocks them. Lock the parent after every child.</p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</h2>
        <details class="toggle">
          <summary>Eliminations didn't post</summary>
          <div class="toggle-body">
            <p>Check that both sides of the intercompany pair use mapped accounts. Unmapped lines are skipped and listed in the close report.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

